<h2>Subscription task estimates</h2><p>A monthly expected-pass calculation is shown only when three facts align: the subscription has a quantified API-equivalent allowance, the external benchmark tested that native agent route, and the benchmark publishes API cost per task. At present the clean join is available for measured Codex plans and native Codex GPT-5.6 configurations. Five-hour windows, shared ChatGPT usage, and workload mix can still bind first.</p>
<h2>External benchmarks and future community runs</h2><p>The current release imports external results only. The community contribution schema pins benchmark version, task-set hash, harness commit, model route, authentication mode, every attempt, verifier output, and redacted artifacts. Community results will remain a separate evidence lane rather than being silently merged into publisher-owned leaderboards.</p>
<h2>Principles enforced by the data model</h2><ul>{principles}</ul></article>'''
    write_page("/methodology/", layout("Methodology", body, "/methodology/"))


def build_community() -> None:
    body = '''<section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Designed now, accepted later</p><h1>Community members run the benchmark; the index validates the evidence.</h1><p class="lede">The current release imports external results only. This page defines the artifact contract for future community contributions so results can be audited, deduplicated, compared, and rejected when the environment or task set is not reproducible.</p></section>
<section class="section compact"><div class="insight-grid"><article class="insight-card"><div class="metric">Pinned</div><h3>Task set and harness</h3><p>Every submission includes a benchmark version, task-set SHA-256 and harness commit, preventing silent task or evaluator drift.</p></article><article class="insight-card blue"><div class="metric">Complete</div><h3>All attempts retained</h3><p>Failed runs and retries stay in the artifact set, so contributors cannot publish only the successful branch.</p></article><article class="insight-card warning"><div class="metric">Reviewable</div><h3>Raw evidence, redacted</h3><p>Logs, verifier output and environment locks are linked by content hash after prompts, code and secrets are removed as required.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Submission builder</p><h2>Create a schema-compatible draft</h2></div><p>This browser-only tool creates a JSON artifact. It does not upload, transmit, or add anything to the benchmark dataset.</p></div><div class="community-grid"><form class="panel form-panel" id="community-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="control"><label for="benchmark-name">Benchmark name</label><input id="benchmark-name" name="benchmarkName" required placeholder="Terminal-Bench"></div><div class="control"><label for="benchmark-version">Version</label><input id="benchmark-version" name="benchmarkVersion" required placeholder="2.1"></div><div class="control wide"><label for="task-hash">Task-set SHA-256</label><input id="task-hash" name="taskHash" required pattern="[a-fA-F0-9]{64}" placeholder="64 hexadecimal characters"></div><div class="control wide"><label for="harness-url">Harness repository URL</label><input id="harness-url" name="harnessUrl" type="url" required placeholder="https://github.com/org/harness"></div><div class="control"><label for="harness-commit">Harness commit</label><input id="harness-commit" name="harnessCommit" required placeholder="git SHA"></div><div class="control"><label for="provider">Provider</label><input id="provider" name="provider" required placeholder="OpenAI"></div><div class="control"><label for="plan-name">Plan</label><input id="plan-name" name="planName" required placeholder="Codex Pro 20x"></div><div class="control"><label for="model-alias">Advertised model alias</label><input id="model-alias" name="modelAlias" required placeholder="GPT-5.6 Sol"></div><div class="control"><label for="resolved-model">Resolved model ID</label><input id="resolved-model" name="resolvedModel"></div><div class="control"><label for="reasoning">Reasoning effort</label><input id="reasoning" name="reasoningEffort" placeholder="max"></div><div class="control"><label for="auth-mode">Authentication</label><select id="auth-mode" name="authenticationMode"><option value="subscription">Subscription</option><option value="api">API</option><option value="sponsored">Sponsored</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="control"><label for="tasks">Tasks</label><input id="tasks" name="taskCount" type="number" min="1" required value="1"></div><div class="control"><label for="attempts">Attempts</label><input id="attempts" name="attemptCount" type="number" min="1" required value="1"></div><div class="control"><label for="passed">Passed</label><input id="passed" name="passedCount" type="number" min="0" required value="0"></div><div class="control"><label for="wall-time">Wall time, seconds</label><input id="wall-time" name="wallTimeSeconds" type="number" min="0" step="0.001" required value="0"></div><div class="control"><label for="cost">API cost equivalent, USD</label><input id="cost" name="apiCostEquivalentUsd" type="number" min="0" step="0.0001"></div><div class="control"><label for="artifact-url">Primary artifact URL</label><input id="artifact-url" name="artifactUrl" type="url" required placeholder="https://…/raw-log.jsonl"></div><div class="control wide"><label for="artifact-hash">Artifact SHA-256</label><input id="artifact-hash" name="artifactHash" required pattern="[a-fA-F0-9]{64}" placeholder="64 hexadecimal characters"></div><div class="control wide"><label for="notes">Attestation notes</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes"></textarea></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Build JSON</button><button class="button" type="button" id="download-submission" disabled>Download draft</button><a class="button subtle" href="/schema/community-benchmark-submission.schema.json">Open JSON Schema</a></div></form><section class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><div><h3>Draft artifact</h3><p>Generated locally in this browser.</p></div></div><pre class="panel-body output-preview" id="submission-preview">Complete the form to generate a submission artifact.</pre></section></div></section>
<section class="section compact prose"><h2>Acceptance path for a later public bench</h2><ol><li><strong>Schema validation:</strong> reject missing hashes, unpinned versions, impossible counts, or incomplete artifact links before human review.</li><li><strong>Artifact verification:</strong> reproduce content hashes, confirm every attempt is present, and verify that evaluator output corresponds to the declared task set.</li><li><strong>Duplicate and anomaly checks:</strong> group submissions by benchmark, harness, model route and task-set hash; flag implausible distributions.</li><li><strong>Reviewed publication:</strong> publish contributor runs in a separate community lane with provenance, never silently merging them into publisher-owned tables.</li></ol></section><script src="/community.js" defer></script>'''
